{"id":2088,"date":"2026-09-29T16:52:19","date_gmt":"2026-09-29T16:52:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/programs\/community-day-services\/"},"modified":"2026-09-29T17:47:45","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T17:47:45","slug":"community-day-services","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/programs\/community-day-services\/","title":{"rendered":"Community Day Services"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2088\" class=\"elementor elementor-2088\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-hero e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"hero\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"page-hero\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-hero_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"hero_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-hero_h1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"hero_h1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Community Day Services<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-hero_p elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"hero_p\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Building Skills. Exploring Interests. Connecting with Others.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_intro e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"pg_intro\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_inner e-con-boxed e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_inner\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_body e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_body\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_side e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_side\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;sticky_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;],&quot;sticky_offset&quot;:120,&quot;sticky_effects_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_anchor_link_offset&quot;:0}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_side_label elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"pg_side_label\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Programs<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_side_list e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_side_list\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_community_day_services e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_community_day_services\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_community_day_services elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_community_day_services\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/community-day-services\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Day Services<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_residential_living e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_residential_living elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/residential-living\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Residential Living<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_health_well_being e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_health_well_being elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/health-well-being\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Health &amp; Well Being<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_special_olympics e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_special_olympics elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/special-olympics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Engagement<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_content e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_content\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ov_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Community Day Services (CDS) offers a variety of classes, experiences and vocational opportunities that help each man build on his strengths, maintain skills and explore his interests. Learning reflects each participant\u2019s individual goals, supporting confidence and greater independence in everyday life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Through social activities, personal living skills, physical fitness, technology and vocational training, participants have opportunities to learn, connect and grow. Browse our classes below to see how we bring learning to life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ov_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1998\" height=\"1563\" src=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2260\" alt=\"Two men working on classroom activities in Community Day Services\" srcset=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg 1998w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-300x235.jpg 300w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1024x801.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-768x601.jpg 768w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1536x1202.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1998px) 100vw, 1998px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ov_2_cap elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ov_2_cap\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Learning and connecting through hands-on activities in Community Day Services.<\/em><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_economics e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_economics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"economics\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_economics_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_economics_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Economics<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-economics_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"economics_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>From recognizing money to planning purchases, Economics connects basic math skills with everyday decisions. Participants practice identifying and writing numbers, understanding money values, using calculators and learning about banking. Budgeting for shopping trips and outings helps each man put these skills into practice while managing his personal funds.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_personal-living-skills e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_personal-living-skills\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"personal-living-skills\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_personal-living-skills_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_personal-living-skills_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Personal Living Skills (PLS)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personal-living-skills_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personal-living-skills_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Personal Living Skills curriculum combines applied skill development tailored to empower men on their journey to self-sufficiency. These skills include personal hygiene, including hand hygiene, shaving, nail care, hair grooming, oral hygiene routines, laundry, bed-making and kitchen cooking, baking and cleaning.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personal-living-skills_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personal-living-skills_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Experiments like the \u2018Glitter Bug\u2019 illuminate the importance of thorough handwashing, revealing the lingering remnants of glitter (germs) left behind. Plaque disclosing tablets or sprays unveil the hidden realms needing extra care during oral hygiene rituals. Moreover, a mock bedroom sanctuary serves as a practical haven for perfecting bed-making finesse and the art of laundry organization, ensuring that learning transcends the mundane to become a vibrant, hands-on adventure.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-personal-living-skills_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"personal-living-skills_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Another component of Personal Living Skills is environmental interaction, a very broad area that includes using safety skills, using different types of transportation and using community facilities, such as the library.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_digital-den e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_digital-den\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"digital-den\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_digital-den_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_digital-den_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Technology\/Communications in the Digital Den<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Good Shepherd Manor, technology is more than a modern amenity \u2014 it\u2019s a gateway to opportunity. It opens doors to independence, education, communication, and meaningful personal growth. For our clients, access to technology means access to the wider world, on their own terms.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our former computer lab, equipped with just a few aging machines, struggled to meet that need. Wait times were long, technical issues frequent, and the setup did not accommodate varying sensory or cognitive needs. The limitations were frustrating not only for our residents, but also for the staff supporting them. We knew it was time for a change.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Funded in 2025, the former computer lab received a major upgrade and is now affectionately referred to as the Digital Den. The lab is designed to serve a broad range of users and learning styles.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"digital-den_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The lab features:<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Modern modular desks with privacy partitions, to reduce distractions and support focused use<\/li><li>A SMART Board interactive flat panel, for group learning, collaborative games, and classroom-style instruction<\/li><li>Amazon Fire HD tablets with noise-canceling headphones, allowing for flexible, accessible engagement with content<\/li><li>Upgraded wiring and secure cable management, with lockable furniture to protect devices and ensure long-term functionality<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These upgrades aren\u2019t just about better equipment, they\u2019re about better experiences. Each addition is tailored to meet residents where they are and empower them to engage, learn, and grow.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-digital-den_6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"digital-den_6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Whether it\u2019s watching favorite shows, learning how to type, sending messages to family, or simply enjoying music in a quiet moment, each use of the Digital Den represents personal progress and meaningful engagement.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_civic-engagement e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_civic-engagement\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"civic-engagement\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_civic-engagement_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_civic-engagement_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Current Events\/Civic Engagement<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-civic-engagement_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"civic-engagement_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>While some may assume that individuals with IDD lack the capacity to engage with political matters, this perception is not only misleading but also overlooks the potential of many. Some individuals with intellectual disabilities can indeed understand complex political issues and engage meaningfully in the democratic and electoral process.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-civic-engagement_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"civic-engagement_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Conversations around current events are welcomed, allowing men who desire to do so to express their thoughts and opinions.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_physical-fitness e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_physical-fitness\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"physical-fitness\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_physical-fitness_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_physical-fitness_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Physical Fitness<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This class uses education and skill building to address all aspects of physical activity, fitness and mobility. Through games and exercises the clients learn about the importance of weight control and remaining physically active.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In 2023, Assembly Hall in CDS was transformed into a recreational space. This space offers men the benefit of audio-visual equipment used to stream exercise videos specifically tailored to individuals with developmental disabilities and\/or limited mobility. There are also a wide range of activities included in this class that promotes physical health, mental sharpness, and social interaction.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Activities such as Chair Yoga usually start the day. During this activity, men find solace and tranquility in gentle stretches and guided breathing exercises. This practice not only promotes flexibility but also promotes a sense of relaxation and mindfulness. Men find themselves embracing a moment of calm before diving into the day\u2019s activities.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Games along the lines of Finish the Phrase, What Am I, and Hangman are often played after physical activities and spark lively anticipation as participants complete well-known phrases or proverbs, guess the object, or solve the word. Laughter fills the room as quick thinking, creative wordplay, and humorous guesses come to life. Such games serve as a mental workout, stimulating men\u2019s mental agility and showcasing their wit.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A fan favorite is indoor baseball. With a soft beach ball and cushioned baseball bat in hand, men take to the makeshift field. Bases marked with chairs provide resting spots between runs, ensuring that everyone can participate. This activity fosters friendly competition, physical activity, and a true sense of community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Scavenger Hunt is another favorite among the men. The hunt injects a sense of adventure into the day. Armed with clues, men embark on a thrilling quest, exploring every nook and cranny of the rec room, sometimes spilling into other areas of the Community Day Center. This activity stimulates problem-solving skills, ignites creativity, and keeps bodies in motion.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Indoor Parachute activity brings together teamwork and physical exertion. Men gather around a large parachute, working in synchrony to lift and lower it, creating vibrant waves of color that fill the room. This cooperative workout not only strengthens their arms but also fosters camaraderie and a sense of unity among participants.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-physical-fitness_7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"physical-fitness_7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>These activities are just a few examples of the diverse range of physical and mindful activities offered. Every week, the recreation space introduces new and exciting ways to stay active and sharp. This dynamic approach ensures that Manor men always have something fresh and engaging to look forward to. With each passing week, they embrace new challenges, forge stronger connections, and continue to thrive in this vibrant recreational haven.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_vocational-classroom e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_vocational-classroom\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"vocational-classroom\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_vocational-classroom_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_vocational-classroom_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Vocational Classroom<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-vocational-classroom_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"vocational-classroom_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The vocational room allows residents to explore a variety of vocational skills, such as, sorting, folding, filing and stuffing. Skills are taught and maintained through pre-established exercises that can prepare the residents for employment or just building skills. There are opportunities for the men in the vocational classrooms to work in the GSM kitchen, the local food pantry, office work at GSM and Navarro Farms.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-vocational-classroom_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"vocational-classroom_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Serving Stars<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-vocational-classroom_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"vocational-classroom_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A recent program called Serving Stars served as a great example of how the vocational classes were able to utilize the technology in the Digital Den. Serving Stars began with a simple idea: give residents with work and volunteer experience a chance to build on what they already knew. Due to the experience in the Vocational classroom the residents understood the basics of being ready for work. Serving Stars gave them a chance to explore why those expectations matter while using technology, sharing their experiences, and learning from one another.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-vocational-classroom_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"vocational-classroom_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Lessons in the Serving Stars program covered workplace readiness, hygiene, food safety, teamwork, restaurant operations, and communication.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_seniors e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_seniors\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"seniors\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_seniors_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_seniors_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Seniors Classrooms<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-seniors_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"seniors_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>There are two classrooms in a self-contained setting designed to address the needs of the clients who are showing signs of aging, are at retirement age or beyond, and have had to make some modifications in life due to aging. This area supports increased interaction but at a pace more conducive to the individual client\u2019s circumstances.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-seniors_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"seniors_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The goal for these classrooms are to assist the residents to remain active and maintain existing skills, to provide opportunities to interact with others who have the same issues and challenges related to aging, to assist in developing coping skills and strategies in dealing with all aspects of aging and to foster an atmosphere of peer support. Both of these classrooms provide a comfortable environment that supports age related changes for each individual, both physically and mentally.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_activities e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_activities\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"activities\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_activities_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_activities_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Additional Activities in Community Day Services<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"activities_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Star-based reward system<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"activities_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Men now earn stars for active participation in each class, which they can redeem for snacks, games, or save up for the much-loved All-Star Lunch. Each month, the top four earners pick their restaurant and choose a staff member to accompany them. There has been a noticeable boost in motivation, pride, and camaraderie.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"activities_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Birthday Celebrations<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"activities_3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every month, the men come together to celebrate those with birthdays, and it\u2019s become a highlight of the CDS experience. The Personal Living Skills class helps bake treats for the celebration, learning and building practical kitchen skills along the way. It\u2019s a chance to grow while giving back and the joy it brings is shared by everyone in the room.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"activities_4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Outings Calendar<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"activities_5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In recent years the outing calendar has been transformed into a passport to new experiences. Men are venturing out to the Strickler Planetarium at Olivet Nazarene University to explore the stars. They\u2019re spending time outdoors with animals at Sandy Oaks Ranch and relaxing with watercolor painting under the trees at Willow Haven Nature Preserve, opportunities that awaken creativity, confidence, and joy.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-activities_6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"activities_6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>And then there\u2019s Navarro Farm, a nonprofit farm designed for individuals with intellectual and developmental disabilities. GSM men head there to learn real agricultural skills and contribute to something meaningful. But more than that, they\u2019re growing a deep sense of independence, purpose, and pride, alongside others who believe in their ability to succeed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Community Day Services Classrooms, activities, and our Digital Den for skill-building and enrichment. Daytime programs built around each person&rsquo;s strengths, interests, and goals. Divider Classrooms, activities, and our Digital Den for skill-building and enrichment. What We Offer We work alongside families, volunteers, and donors to make a meaningful difference in the daily lives of the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":317,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"disabled","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-conten